# Paths the PR reviewer skips — excluded from the MAX_ADDITIONS /
# MAX_CHANGED_FILES size gate and from the reviewer's context.

# Machine-produced frozen changelog archive — rotated out of CHANGELOG.md by
# scripts/changelog-archive.py and never hand-edited. It is moved prose, not
# authored content: scripts/tests/test_changelog_archive.py pins it byte-for-byte
# against the input and asserts the retained and archived section counts sum to
# the source's. Left in the reviewable set it is ~1900 added lines of frozen
# history, which parks every archive PR at human_review on the size gate alone.
CHANGELOG-archive.md
